# Raystrat Systems — environment variables
# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and fill in real values locally.
# Never commit a populated file: `.gitignore` matches `.env*`.

# preview | production
# `production` is the ONLY switch that enables search indexing:
# it removes the noindex meta tag + X-Robots-Tag header and makes
# /robots.txt allow crawling and publish the sitemap reference.
SITE_ENV=preview

# The enquiry form submits directly, client-side, to Formspree
# (https://formspree.io/f/mbgjagaz — see app/lib/site.ts FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT).
# No server-side credential is required for this: there is no Resend/SMTP
# integration in this codebase anymore. Recipient routing, the sending
# domain, and any spam/reCAPTCHA settings are configured entirely in the
# Formspree dashboard for that form, not via environment variables here.
